{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T08:31:04.967Z","ordinal":18710,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a099d0-3015-7732-b534-5b9f4604a0b7","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa65f47b09487d2857d0abae38c5ae8","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Implemented and pushed to `main` as commit `369a720`.\n\n- Added `rationale-v6` model selector.\n- Connected exact checkpoint `7c69114d…`.\n- Preserved canary-v4 as default.\n- Matched v6’s rationale-first prompt contract.\n- Fixed proxy streaming for the second inference service.\n- Browser-tested real v6 inference.\n- Passed 121 frontend and 31 inference tests; production build passes.\n\nKnown issue: v6 sometimes generates an invalid zero-width evidence interval. The UI now reports that honestly instead of repairing it."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789288263754,"completed_at_ms":1789288264967}}
