n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t150 Text 03\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t151 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t152 Text Next-Gen RAG\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t153 Text We build and evaluate agentic Al applications across a\r\nvariety of industries, from insurance and finance to\r\neducation and scientific research.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t154 Text We develop Time-Series Language Models (TSLMs) and\r\nAudio-Language Models (ALMs) to reason over and predict\r\ntemporal data in healthcare, manufacturing,\r\ntelecommunications, and energy.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t155 Text Next-Gen RAG systems that autonomously plan and optimize\r\nretrieval. AutoRAG configures pipelines automatically;\r\nMetaRAG orchestrates multiple strategies for reliable,\r\ngrounded outputs.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t156 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t157 Text 04\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t158 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t159 Text World Models\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t160 Text We research world models that learn compressed\r\nrepresentations of environments, enabling Al systems to\r\nsimulate, plan, and reason about complex real-world\r\ndynamics.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t161 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t162 Text 05\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t163 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t164 Text Al Evaluation Frameworks\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t165 Text Creating benchmarks and methodologies to measure\r\nperformance, safety, and reliability of Al Agents and\r\nmultimodal LLMs.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t166 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t167 Text 06\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t168 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t169 Text Al Transformation\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t170 Text We research how Al can transform existing enterprise\r\noperations. Our work spans user discovery and problem\r\nvalidation to ensure meaningful applications of Al, as well as\r\nthe design of aligned and controllable Al systems that\r\nintegrate reliably into real-world workflows.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t171 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t