t453 Text 01\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t454 Text PROBLEM + DATA\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t455 Text Identify a target user and \r\nproblem, then source open data. \r\nWhere useful, build an agentic \r\npipeline to search, assess, select, \r\nretrieve, or validate datasets.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t456 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t457 Text 02\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t458 Text CONNECT\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t459 Text Use or build a TimeNet connector \r\nfor signals, metadata, and \r\nannotations. Define the questions, \r\nlabels, or other learning targets.\r\nReusable ingestion pipelines are \r\nespecially valuable.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t460 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t461 Text 03\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t462 Text TRAIN + EVALUATE\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t463 Text Train or fine-tune a TSLM. \r\nCompare it with a baseline on held\u0002out data, avoiding leakage across \r\ntime, subjects, or devices.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t464 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t465 Text 04\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t466 Text DEMONSTRATE\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t467 Text Show how you sourced the data, \r\nreal inputs, model outputs, and how \r\nthe result helps the target user. \r\nExplain the evidence and \r\nlimitations.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t468 Text Open infrastructure that standardises time\u0002series data and metadata for TSLM training.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t469 Text Ideal Data Profile\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t470 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t471 Text • A dataset with time-series and \r\ntext reasoning over it / or \r\ndescribing it\r\n• In some cases, you might \r\nconsider generating text \r\nannotations with LLMs (as in \r\nOpenTSLM paper)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t472 Bild /workspace/scratch/d6f24856070f/tmp/build/eth-asl-official.png\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t473 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t474 Bild /workspace/scratch/d6f24856070f/tmp/build/timenet-github-qr-tight.png\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t475 container Seite 17\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t476 Text TEMPORAL AI CHALLENGE\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t477 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t478 Text What You Get, What You Submit\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t479 Text - 14 -\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t480 Text YOUR RESOURCES\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t481 Text • TimeNet access\r\n• Access to training compute\r\n• OpenTSLM as a reference\r\n• Technical guidance from Aionic Labs + ASL\r\n→ Discord\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t482 Text YOU SUBMIT\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t483 Text • Working demo\r\n• Code + training configuration\r\n• Checkpoint or adapter\r\n• Dataset documentation\r\n• Short evaluation with baseline comparison\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t484 Text FINAL PRESENTATION Live demo to the jury: problem, approach, results, and key learnings\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t485 Text WHAT MAKES A STRONG PROJECT\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t486 Text • A useful problem\r\n• Thoughtful data preparation \r\n• Adequate TSLM training\r\n• Rigorous evaluation\r\n• A clear demonstration\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t487 Text • Well-chosen datasets and reusable TimeNet connectors \r\nthat others can build on.\r\n• Agentic pipelines for automated search, assessment, \r\nselection, retrieval, or validation of datasets are a plus\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t488 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t489 Text BONUS POINTS\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t490 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t491 Bild /workspace/scratch/d6f24856070f/tmp/build/eth-asl-official.png\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t492 container Seite 18\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t493 Text - 18 -\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t494 Text TEMPORAL AI CHALLENGE\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t495 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t496 Text We need more…\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t497 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t498 Bild What Do Actors Snort in Movies? | Backstage\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t499 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t500 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t501 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t502 container Seite 19\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t503 Text - 19 -\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t504 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t505 Text NEBIUS saves the Day.\r\nNO EXCUSES TODAY\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t506 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t507 Text $1000 compute voucher per team\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t508 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t509 Text ...and more for the winners\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t510 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t511 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t512 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t513 container Seite 20\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t514 Text - 20 -\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t515 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t516 Text Nebius: the full-stack AI cloud.\r\nOUR COMPUTE PARTNER\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t517 Text Global AI cloud · HQ Amsterdam · NASDAQ: NBIS · GPUs to inference & agentic search · deep NVIDIA partnership\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t518 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t519 Text 5 GW\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t520 Text contracted power target\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t521 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t522 Text 1 GW+\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t523 Text added every year from 2027\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t524 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t525 Text Full stack\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t526 Text GPUs, inference & search\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t527 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t528 Text Newest GPUs\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t529 Text Blackwell Ultra live today\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t530 Text New in Zurich\r\nThe Zurich office opens mid-September\r\nNebius' agentic search hub with the \r\nTavily team on board, and home of the \r\nDACH startup crew. \r\nSay hi to Jennifer Werthwein!\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t531 Text Fuel for builders\r\nStartup credits, research grants, the \r\nBuilder Program and the Early Talent \r\nProgram (winter cohort Jan 2027) \r\nStart at nebius.com/startups.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t532 Text This weekend\r\nYou can train on Nebius GPUs with \r\nsponsored vouchers\r\nThe most promising teams get follow-on \r\ncredits to keep building after Sunday.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t533 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t534 Text Not just infrastructure. A complete platform for anyone building AI products, agents or services.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t535 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t536 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t537 container Seite 21\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t538 Text - 21 -\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t539 Kopfzeile 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t540 Text Credits, grants and careers - three ways in.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t541 Text NEBIUS FOR FOUNDERS & STUDENTS\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t542 Text NEBIUS Programs for founding, researching or graduatin\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t543 Text Nebius for Startups\r\nNVIDIA Inception members and \r\nselected VCs can nominate startups for \r\nthe credit program.\r\nIncluding vertical tracks, e.g. the \r\nRobotics & Physical AI Awards with \r\ncompute and inference credits.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t544 Text • nebius.com/startups\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t545 Text Research & builders\r\nResearch grants: compute credits via \r\nNebius Academy. Nebius Fellows for \r\nindividual builders.\r\nBuilder Program (early preview): Token \r\nFactory & Tavily credits, training, office \r\nhours and community.\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t546 Text • nebius.com/nebius-research\u0002grants\r\n• dev.nebius.com/builders \r\n• nebius.com/fellows\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t547 Text Early Talent Program\r\nRecent grads & final-year students · 2–\r\n6 months, office-based, paid like a \r\njunior full-timer.\r\nReal product ownership from day one, a \r\ndedicated mentor (and maybe a full\u0002time offer.)\r\nWinter cohort Jan 2027 → apply by Dec \r\n31 (Paris, Amsterdam, Tel Aviv, Finland, \r\nUS)\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t548 Text • nebius.com/early-talent-program\r\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t549 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t550 Text Nebius supports you building with credits, compute and your first job.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t551 Bild Bild ohne Label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t552 Bild Bild ohne Label\n