h the SSH tunnel): one full analyze-interval round trip takes about **24 seconds**. Do not start another query during the timed demo. Say that the visible result is the current canary-v4 output for this exact 7×1,024 input. If a judge requests fresh inference, run it after the core story. Only one query is served at a time; do not queue clicks.\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"2df63d\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.00000225,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":211,\"output\":\"total 72\\ndrwx------@ 12 sametdegirmenci  staff   384 Sep 13 00:49 .\\ndrwxr-x---+ 70 sametdegirmenci  staff  2240 Sep 13 09:21 ..\\ndrwx------   3 sametdegirmenci  staff    96 Sep 12 17:13 agent\\n-rw-------   1 sametdegirmenci  staff    92 Jul 13 17:07 authorized_keys\\n-rw-------@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff   432 Jun  5 16:54 hetzner\\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff   113 Jun  5 16:54 hetzner.pub\\n-rw-------@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff   399 Jul 13 17:04 id_ed25519\\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff    92 Jul 13 17:04 id_ed25519.pub\\n-rw-------@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff  2129 Sep 13 00:49 known_hosts\\n-rw-------@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff  1393 Sep 13 00:49 known_hosts.old\\n-rw-------@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff   419 Sep 13 00:40 trace-nebius-inference\\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff   104 Sep 13 00:40 trace-nebius-inference.pub\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a099fb-4997-7e70-8ec5-d3f71bf37a98","create_time":1789289786.65044}}}
