igin.................... done\\nTo https://github.com/ukafkasyali/ysamet\\n   333b2b9..1b3ab07  main -\u003e main\\n\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa664848ce087d29a8b57a9d692fb42","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a099f5-6a73-75a1-b7c4-e4bf48c16117"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"You were right—it was two confusing controls for one decision.\n\nNow there is one **Analysis source** menu:\n\n- canary-v4 + measurements\n- rationale-v6 + measurements\n- Measurements only\n\nIt controls both interval analysis and custom questions. Pushed as `1b3ab07`; 121 tests and build pass.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa66484b58887d29481c355aa122d42","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"turn_id":"01a099f5-6a73-75a1-b7c4-e4bf48c16117"},"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Can you please execute from the VM with the samet ssh key or not:\nPUBLIC\\_KEY='ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAINXWYkehEnJZT0GByN0Kh0rQD1YiJq7DkYrwkp7YCWYh codex-nebius-h100'  mkdir -p \\~/.ssh chmod 700 \\~/.ssh touch \\~/.ssh/authorized\\_keys grep -qxF \"$PUBLIC\\_KEY\" \\~/.ssh/authorized\\_keys || printf '%s\\n' \"$PUBLIC\\_KEY\" \u003e\u003e \\~/.ssh/authorized\\_keys chmod 600 \\~/.ssh/authorized\\_keys\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a099fb-4ad8-7560-a960-1ede33bb1468","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1789289777.880125,"turn_id":"01a099fb-4997-7e70-8ec5-d3f71bf37a98"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa66536903887d287dd8ffcc4a7de7f","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a099fb-4997-7e70-8ec5-d3f71bf37a98"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"I’ll add this exact public key to Samet’s VM account idempotently, then verify the line exists with the correct SSH file permissions.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa665387f2087d29231583e3e5197df","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"turn_id":"01a099fb-4997-7e70-8ec5-d3f71bf37a98"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_XZkvjHBYTNLlVjq7l3rk1a7z","id":"ctc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa66538f72c87d2a04610cb74687e8e","input":"const r = await Promise.all([\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n \\\"ssh .*89\\\\.169\\\\.110\\\\.3|IdentityFile|samet@|SSH\\\" inference/README.md docs -g '*.md'\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":4000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"ls -la ~/.ssh\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":2000})\n]); r.forEach(text);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789289778.287087,"turn_id":"01a099fb-4997-7e70-8ec5-d3f71bf37a98"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_XZkvjHBYTNLlVjq7l3rk1a7z","id":"ctco_01a099fb-6d1a-7050-8883-05337a1e89bb","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789289786.65044,"turn_id":"01a099fb-4997-7e70-8ec5-d3f71bf37a98"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"54a4f2\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000001208,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":468,\"output\":\"docs/submission/CHECKPOINT_HANDOFF.md:41:Never include an access token, SSH private key, service log with credentials, or\\ninference/README.md:5:The KUKA OpenTSLM-SP adapter is loaded and the SSH tunnel, Vite proxy and real\\ninference/README.md:30:The VM is `samet@89.169.110.3`. After your Hugging Face account has access to the\\ninference/README.md:34:ssh -t samet@89.169.110.3 '~/trace-inference/inference/.venv/bin/hf auth login'\\ninference/README.md:47:`VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api` in gitignored `.env.local`; reconnect the SSH tunnel below\\ninference/README.md:61:machines**. Open a running VM and inspect its GPU type/count, public IP and SSH\\ninference/README.md:63:An allocated training job is not necessarily a persistent VM you can SSH into.\\ninference/README.md:85:image and your **public** SSH key. One GPU is the starting point; check the available\\ninference/README.md:193:The existing `/api` development proxy targets the local SSH tunnel. Alternatively\\ninference/README.md:289:[Nebius SSH connection](https://docs.nebius.com/compute/virtual-machines/connect),\\ndocs/submission/UI_WALKTHROUGH.md:4:SSH tunnel, and the private Nebius inference bridge. This is a replay walkthrough,\\ndocs/FRONTEND_INTEGRATION.md:6:[`inference/README.md`](../inference/README.md) for the Nebius VM, SSH tunnel,\\ndocs/FRONTEND_INTEGRATION.md:9:Vite and SSH returns the exact initial historical window. Model loading awaits\\ndocs/submission/DEMO.md:9:Timing, measured 13 September 2026 on the current CPU-only deployment (two smoke runs through the SSH tunnel): one full analyze-interval round trip takes about **24 seconds**. Do not start another query during the timed demo. Say that the visible result is the current canary-v4 output for this exact 7×1,024 input. If a judge requests fresh inference, run it after the core story. Only one query is served at a time; do not queue clicks.\\n\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"2df63d\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.00000225,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":211,\"output\":\"total 72\\ndrwx------@ 12 sametdegirmenci  staff   384 Sep 13 00:49 .\\ndrwxr-x---+ 70 sametdegirmenci  staff  2240 Sep 13 09:21 ..\\ndrwx------   3 sametdegirmenci  staff    96 Sep 12 17:13 agent\\n-rw-------   1 sametdegirmenci  staff    92 Jul 13 17:07 authorized_keys\\n-rw-------@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff   432 Jun  5 16:54 hetzner\\n-rw-r--r--@  1 sametdegirmenci  staff   113 Jun  5 16:54 hetzner